 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm great, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm a student and I want to build my first gaming PC. My budget is tiny.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "block": "video_games.dlg8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Doable. The trick on a tight budget is putting most of the money into the graphics card, since that matters most for games.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What about everything else?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 3.36,
   "block": "video_games.dlg8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A mid range processor is plenty. Sixteen gigabytes of memory, and a solid state drive so games load fast. Don't overspend on a fancy case.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 1.66,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is used stuff a good idea?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "block": "video_games.dlg8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Used graphics cards can be great value, just buy from someone with good feedback and test it if you can. I'd buy the power supply new though.",
   "est_sec": 8.47,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Why the power supply?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "block": "video_games.dlg8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A cheap or worn out one can fail and take other parts with it. It's not exciting, but it protects everything else.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay. I'm slightly",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.39,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "video_games.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "terrified of putting it together.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.82,
   "block": "video_games.dlg8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Most people are the first time. Follow a video slowly, and it's really just careful Lego.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg8"
  }
